WEBVTT

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:13.420
<i>A new kind of disease has been 
spreading among young people.</i>

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.580
<i>Following prolonged 
periods of Internet usage,</i>

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:23.420
<i>sufferers develop a pathological 
dependence on the Internet.</i>

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:28.210
<i>Experts have named this 
disease "Internet Addiction."</i>

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:35.100
<i>In order to get these addicted 
youngsters back on the right track</i>

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:39.140
<i>and reform them into independent, 
self-respecting adults,</i>

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:45.940
<i>the Elite Reeducation Academy,
a civilian educational facility, was created.</i>

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:53.770
<i>It is a place to help young 
people to grow up right.</i>

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:02.040
<i>When people are born, 
they are naturally good.</i>

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:07.040
<i>Their natures are similar, 
though they differ based on custom.</i>

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:11.650
<i>Without proper teaching, 
their good nature aberrates.</i>

00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:15.890
<i>A thoroughness in teaching is essential.</i>

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:19.640
<i>Long ago, the mother of Mengzi sought 
an appropriate environment for her child.</i>

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:22.560
<i>To provide insufficient education 
is to break the shuttle of the loom.</i>

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:26.550
<i>Tou of the Swallow Hills 
did as he should.</i>

00:01:27.070 --> 00:01:29.560
<i>He taught five children, 
who made names for themselves.</i>

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:31.930
<i>A father sins if he raises 
a child without education.</i>

00:01:31.930 --> 00:01:36.210
<i>An instructor is negligent 
if he teaches without rigor.</i>

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:39.030
Episode 1
"Standing on the Edge of Despair"

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:41.180
<i>It is not good for a child 
to go without learning.</i>

00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:46.540
<i>If one does not learn when young, 
what can one accomplish in old age?</i>

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:49.580
18+ Only
Please Present ID

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:50.580
<i>A jewel of natural beauty, 
without polish, is useless.</i>

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:54.090
<i>A child of great promise, 
without education, is ignorant.</i>

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:59.590
<i>All children born to their 
parents, while still young,</i>

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:03.100
<i>must have proper teachers and 
friends and learn good manners.</i>

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:02.680
Study hard!

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:08.260
<i>Xiang, at nine years old, 
could warm his father's pillow.</i>

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:13.290
<i>Fidelity to our parents is 
something we all should practice.</i>

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:18.250
<i>Yung, at age four, could yield 
pears to his older brother.</i>

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:23.000
<i>Obedience to our elders 
is the first thing we must learn.</i>

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:26.120
<i>Fidelity to parents and respect 
for elders comes first.</i>

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:30.180
<i>We then expand our vision, 
learn to count and to read.</i>

00:02:30.490 --> 00:02:33.020
<i>From one to ten, from ten to a hundred.</i>

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:42.340
<i>From a hundred to a thousand, 
a thousand to ten thousand...</i>

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:45.120
Die, die, die!

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:47.400
All of you die, God damn it!

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:51.270
We're here!

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.320
Let's go!

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:54.020
You think they have 
open seats with this crowd?

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:54.610
Let's check it out.

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:55.860
Hey, three spots! Perfect!

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:58.070
Great! Let's hurry!

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:00.900
Hey, you guys! Cram a little further in!

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:02.060
Yeah, got it!

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:04.430
Amazing!

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:06.370
Let's keep it up!

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:07.400
Let's get going.

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:08.250
One more round!

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:11.700
What's going on?

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:25.120
Hibiki-chan.

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:27.100
Hibiki-chan.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:29.410
Wake up. We're going to play a game.

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:32.320
No need to go to school.

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:34.420
Come on, wake up.

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:36.130
Hibiki-chan.

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:38.370
Hibiki-chan...

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:59.160
Where am I?

00:04:01.210 --> 00:04:03.440
Hey, he's awake.

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:04.740
Who cares?

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:06.040
How's the door coming?

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:07.690
It seems to be locked from the outside.

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:12.680
I've time traveled into a game world!

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:16.800
A team of four and a locked room! 
That's gotta be it!

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:21.080
Hey... you're a soldier, right?

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:21.740
What are we fighting?

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:24.810
Zombies? Monsters?

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:27.360
I only just woke up, so please, tell me!

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:29.370
What are you jabbering about, dumbass?

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:30.740
You're the only one who was unconscious.

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:32.730
If you don't know what's going on, 
shut up and sit down.

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:34.160
I'm not in a real great mood right now.

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:35.250
Quiet.

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:39.280
Someone's...

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:44.890
coming this way.

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:59.770
Are these the guys we're fighting?

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:07.490
Is this all the garbage we got today?

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:12.780
I suppose I'll introduce myself.

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:20.690
This is a recycling facility for trash, 
Elite Reeducation Academy. Welcome.

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:24.130
I am the headmistress, Jean.

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:27.160
What? Headmistress?

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:34.970
Forgive me, Instructor.

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:36.650
I can't take any more.

00:05:36.650 --> 00:05:38.160
Please, let me rest.

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:42.530
The rest of you... say something.

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:44.860
We've been running since morning.

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:46.320
I know you want to rest, too!

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:54.320
Lock him up! 
Don't let him out for three days!

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:55.860
The rest of you, 
ten laps around the field!

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:57.630
Whoever's last gets an extra five laps!

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.000
Get to it!

00:05:59.000 --> 00:05:59.860
Yes, sir!

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:07.330
I can never get enough 
of those beautiful groans.

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:09.040
Let's see.

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:12.430
What kind of garbage 
do we have in today?

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:15.690
Damn. What the hell...

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:17.350
I know this is no school!

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:19.460
It's a rehab facility for Internet addiction!

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:21.640
I lead a guild of 100,000 people!

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:22.480
Out of my way!

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:24.860
You better believe 
I'll kill you if you don't!

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:27.540
Yeah, get out of our way!

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:29.590
And how dare you hit me, anyway!

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:32.650
You bastards tricked me!

00:06:37.670 --> 00:06:40.180
What? Didn't you hear me?

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:49.080
Try not to damage any faces.

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:50.880
Their parents will 
be coming next month.

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:52.880
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:55.890
What's going on here?
Did I not really travel through time?
Are we not supposed to fight them?

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:01.230
Did I not travel through time? 
Is this reality?

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:01.560
<b>Reality?</b>

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:02.400
Reality? Reality? Reality? Reality? Reality?

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:03.560
Reality?Reality?Reality?Reality?Reality?

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:06.150
Stop it!

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:07.320
This is reality.

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:20.620
I am the school's head instructor, Shian.

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:22.410
You three.

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:25.420
Line up right now.

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.710
Y-Yes sir.

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:31.610
Now, I want you to remember this.

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:35.600
At this school, you will obey only

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:38.640
the headmistress and myself.

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:39.880
Understood?

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:41.000
Yes, sir.

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:42.200
I can't hear you!

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:43.310
Yes, sir!

00:07:45.530 --> 00:07:48.820
Finish things for me here, 
Head Instructor.

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:50.820
I will now take roll.

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:52.000
Daii!

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:52.780
Present!

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:53.590
Hou!

00:07:53.590 --> 00:07:54.470
Present!

00:07:54.470 --> 00:07:55.400
Sei!

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:57.450
Sei!

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:00.880
Oh, so he's the one I laid out?

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:02.450
Last, Hibiki!

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:03.510
P-Present!

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:06.270
So that's you, eh?

00:08:06.270 --> 00:08:08.330
The abandoned garbage?

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:11.470
What did you say?

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:13.770
Hibiki, age 17.

00:08:13.770 --> 00:08:15.540
Severe Internet addiction.

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:19.970
At his mother's request, 
he's to be quarantined until he turns 18.

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:22.410
Visits prohibited. Outings prohibited.

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:24.660
As your condition's severity inclines 
you to gross disobedience,

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:26.980
you were rendered unconscious 
and forcibly enrolled.

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:32.130
Literally treated like trash.

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:39.000
Let's see...

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:41.200
What's his record like?

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:45.610
You've got to be kidding.

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:47.000
Severe Internet addiction?

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:48.900
Quarantined here, for a year?

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:50.690
There's got to be a mistake.

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:52.010
Let me call my mother!

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:56.310
It was your mother's request 
that we bring you here!

00:08:57.450 --> 00:08:58.750
Y-You're kidding...

00:08:58.750 --> 00:09:00.180
My mother...

00:09:01.090 --> 00:09:02.560
By the way, brat.

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:06.330
I saw you casting glances 
at the headmistress earlier.

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:10.400
I... I wasn't looking.

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:16.150
This is reality.

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:16.660
Reality.

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:17.030
Reality.

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:18.600
She's very beautiful.

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:20.030
You really want to tell me you weren't looking?

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:22.690
You're insulting the 
headmistress, is that it?

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:25.040
Let me ask you once more. 
You looked, didn't you?!

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:26.040
Reality.

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:31.050
Y-Yes...

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:33.760
I-I looked.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:39.050
You're too young to be so deviant!

00:09:39.380 --> 00:09:43.320
Watching adult videos on the Internet 
has filled your head with perversion!

00:09:43.320 --> 00:09:46.940
And how dare you lie to me, 
you piece of shit trash!

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:49.610
I'm going to punish you! Severely!

00:09:50.430 --> 00:09:53.030
Get it into your head 
just how stupid you are!

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:56.690
Reflect on what you've done.

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:58.360
Reality.

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:04.080
<i>No matter how I answer... 
I'm going to get hit.</i>

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:06.370
<i>That instructor is a monster.</i>

00:10:06.820 --> 00:10:08.820
Let's get you initiated.

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:10.380
Follow me.

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:12.880
Come on, hurry up!

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:13.840
Run away.

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:23.100
Elite Reeducation Academy

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:23.090
Don't shrink away!

00:10:25.460 --> 00:10:26.810
Stand straight!

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:29.060
Now, get changed!

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:31.800
I don't want to see you in fancy clothes 
when you can't even study right!

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:33.820
We're going to knock those 
stupid ideas right out of you!

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:36.180
Stop standing there and get changed!

00:10:36.180 --> 00:10:37.730
Y-Yes sir.

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:42.280
This place is terrifying.

00:10:38.350 --> 00:10:39.570
Run away.

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:40.610
Run away.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:45.020
You will be in room 420.

00:10:45.020 --> 00:10:47.200
You'll be awake with beds made by 7:00 AM

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:49.130
and be back in the dorms by 9:00 PM.

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:51.680
The superintendent will 
explain the other rules.

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:54.130
What's wrong?

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:58.650
Instructor... I can't walk any more.

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:02.230
Get up! You want 
another beating, do you?

00:11:02.230 --> 00:11:04.120
Even if you can't stand, 
you can still walk!

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:06.640
You brat!

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:12.620
Let's go.

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:13.480
Run away.

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.230
Run away Run away Run away Run away

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:17.150
<i>I need to run away...</i>

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:20.120
<i>If I stay here, I'll be killed!</i>

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:25.340
<i>But where am I going to go?</i>

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:29.360
Hibiki-chan, dinner's ready.

00:11:29.360 --> 00:11:30.990
I'm busy!

00:11:31.430 --> 00:11:33.740
If you don't eat it soon, it'll get cold.

00:11:33.740 --> 00:11:36.420
Are you deaf? I said I'm busy!

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:37.970
What time will you be back?

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:39.430
Internet Café

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:39.420
I won't be back tonight.

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:41.970
Shut up! Just leave me alone!

00:12:04.400 --> 00:12:05.610
<i>I have...</i>

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:13.150
<i>nowhere to go...</i>

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:20.340
Heya.

00:12:21.480 --> 00:12:24.960
What with it being lunchtime and all, 
why don't we have a little chat?

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:27.560
Forget him. Let's go.

00:12:27.560 --> 00:12:28.810
Drat.

00:12:30.050 --> 00:12:32.180
Instructor, is this the new blood?

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:33.030
Yeah.

00:12:33.030 --> 00:12:36.060
Since you're the discipline officer, 
I hope you'll show them the ropes.

00:12:36.340 --> 00:12:39.070
Got it. Leave the three of them to me.

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:40.200
Three?

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:42.160
Hey, we're missing one!

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:46.450
That snot-nosed brat.

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:47.560
Find him!

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:53.100
You newcomers get to see what 
happens to runaways!

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:55.840
Find him! Split up and search!

00:12:58.470 --> 00:13:00.340
What do I do?

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:02.380
I can't bear this kind of treatment...

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:04.090
I want to die.

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:05.930
If I die...

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:14.590
Hey, hey. Gonna plunge 
to your death, huh?

00:13:14.590 --> 00:13:15.930
That's perfect.

00:13:15.930 --> 00:13:16.850
Who's there?

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:20.750
You want to jump, right?

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:22.520
Mind if I push you?

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:25.260
What do you care if I die?

00:13:25.260 --> 00:13:26.610
Just leave me alone!

00:13:28.630 --> 00:13:32.690
I'm supposed to sit back and watch 
while a classmate jumps to his death?

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:37.130
You should really take aim, though.

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:39.050
If you landed on someone...

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:42.130
Well, then things might  
get pretty interesting.

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:45.870
What...

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:49.280
What are you talking about? 
This is insane!

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:52.810
You're crazy! 
Everyone at this school is crazy!

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:54.140
Calm down, now.

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:57.140
What are you doing?

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:58.250
Stay back!

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:00.360
If you come any closer, 
I really will jump!

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:07.040
If you want to jump, do it.

00:14:07.440 --> 00:14:09.160
What's taking you so long?

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:11.890
Look down.

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:14.770
You should jump when 
the instructor walks by.

00:14:14.770 --> 00:14:16.160
Really take aim.

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:18.560
He's the one who beat 
you up before, right?

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:20.660
If you're going to jump 
to your death either way,

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:22.730
it would be a shame 
not to take him out with you.

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:23.530
Am I right?

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:24.230
Stop it!

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:26.510
You're crazy! What are you doing?

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:29.330
What do you think? 
I'm assisting your suicide.

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:32.910
A 17-year-old boy risks 
his life to fight the authorities,

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:35.680
teaches the world about the 
school's shady illegal activities,

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:39.180
and sets the entire student 
population of 1,000 free.

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:41.970
Do it, and you can be a hero.

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:50.360
Die Die Die Die Die Die Die

00:14:49.940 --> 00:14:50.690
I won't!

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:50.700
Die

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:52.690
I've decided not to jump!

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:58.990
When trash like you dies,

00:14:58.990 --> 00:15:00.930
it's just a waste.

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:04.420
Sell your life to me.

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:06.750
I'll give your life meaning.

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:07.840
How about it?

00:15:10.030 --> 00:15:11.720
Give my life meaning?

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:16.230
What meaning can I possibly find 
in this place, besides suffering?

00:15:16.760 --> 00:15:19.580
If you die, everything just ends.

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:21.280
But if you live...

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:24.960
Come with me.

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:28.230
I'm going to make you...

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:34.820
A real man!

00:15:37.110 --> 00:15:40.510
Make me... a real man?

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:42.860
No need to be suspicious.

00:15:42.860 --> 00:15:45.000
It's what you want.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:45.210
What is he talking about?
Make me a real man?
What does "real" mean?

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:45.420
He's not talking about... <i>that</i>, is he?

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:45.630
No, no, no, no, no way!
He's crazy!
I can't trust anything he says!

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:45.840
No, no, no, I won't be fooled!
Why has everything gotten so weird?
I was just trying to kill myself!

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:46.250
But...

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:49.460
Th-That's not true...

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:51.600
I don't really want to be a man...

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:52.970
Oh, really?

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:54.480
Then, go jump.

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:57.810
Now that I've thought about it,

00:15:57.810 --> 00:16:02.520
I think if I end my life here, 
it might feel... sort of incomplete?

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:06.340
And I didn't realize until 
you said it. I'm sorry.

00:16:08.290 --> 00:16:10.760
That you were a girl...

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:13.420
I mean, like, your chest's kind of small.

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:15.420
You're a little underdeveloped, I guess.

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:17.200
I'm not obsessed with breasts,

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:20.970
so I don't know a lot about it, 
but you might want to wear a bra...

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:27.350
If you're a man, you should 
have said so sooner!

00:16:27.350 --> 00:16:29.650
With all that talk about 
making me a man...

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:32.560
Hey, wait! Stay back!

00:16:32.560 --> 00:16:33.680
I'm not into dudes!

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:36.220
No way will I let a guy pop my cherry!

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:46.300
Say one more dumbass thing, 
and I'll show you true pain!

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:48.310
You won't have to jump off 
a building to die!

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:51.850
He wasn't in the dorm.

00:16:51.850 --> 00:16:55.820
If we don't find him, we're the ones who'll 
get a beating from the head instructor.

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:57.260
You try the cafeteria.

00:16:57.260 --> 00:16:58.370
We'll try the second school building.

00:16:58.370 --> 00:16:59.280
Right!

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:04.450
Use these.

00:17:05.110 --> 00:17:07.420
Binoculars? How did you get these?

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:09.130
Do as I tell you.

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:12.170
Use them to look at the field over there.

00:17:12.560 --> 00:17:14.700
It's lunch recess right now, after all.

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:18.220
Choose any girl you like from that field.

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:19.840
I'll make your wish come true.

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:23.110
What? You're kidding, right?

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:24.980
Just choose.

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:28.640
Girls in the prime flower of youth.

00:17:29.030 --> 00:17:32.440
Black hair. Smooth skin.

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:36.360
Their beauty can't be hidden, 
no matter how lame the uniform.

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:42.370
I bet you've only ever 
interacted with computers

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:45.470
and never even held 
a girl's hand, am I right?

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:48.090
If you do what I tell you,

00:17:48.090 --> 00:17:50.880
you can pick as many of those 
beautiful flowers as you can hold.

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:53.260
F-Fine. I'll do what you say.

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:54.880
But you'd better keep your promise!

00:17:56.880 --> 00:18:00.890
I never knew there were 
so many girls at this school.

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:03.600
Are they all Internet addicts?

00:18:05.150 --> 00:18:08.090
That girl... can it be...

00:18:11.350 --> 00:18:12.960
Shiori?

00:18:15.020 --> 00:18:17.010
But... what's she doing here?

00:18:17.010 --> 00:18:18.420
Let me see. Which one?

00:18:20.310 --> 00:18:22.060
Hey, nice taste.

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:23.080
You know her?

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:24.780
Yeah...

00:18:24.780 --> 00:18:27.660
We went to middle school together.

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:31.140
She has Internet addiction?

00:18:31.140 --> 00:18:33.670
That can't be true! 
She was an honor student!

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:36.250
She's the one, then.

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:39.810
N-No way! She'll never say yes.

00:18:39.810 --> 00:18:44.700
If she'd even just look at me... 
that would be enough.

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:46.760
You are <i>pathetic</i>.

00:18:46.760 --> 00:18:50.610
Your personal goddess 
will soon be yours.

00:18:50.610 --> 00:18:52.540
You asked for it, you got it.

00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:54.460
But it's not possible!

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:55.690
What are you going to do?

00:18:56.890 --> 00:18:57.980
Hibiki.

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:00.800
How do you know my name?

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:02.950
Never mind about that.

00:19:03.300 --> 00:19:08.520
As of this moment, your life 
and your body belong to me.

00:19:08.520 --> 00:19:09.950
Don't forget that.

00:19:10.270 --> 00:19:13.810
And I, your master,

00:19:14.390 --> 00:19:15.460
am Shin.

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:16.650
Remember it.

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:19.130
Idiots!

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:21.670
Some newbie brat gave you the slip?

00:19:21.670 --> 00:19:23.020
We're sorry.

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:24.960
We didn't realize he'd still 
have the strength to run.

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:27.810
Shut up! Don't let him get away.

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:30.510
Search! And find him fast!

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:32.620
Don't get so mad.

00:19:32.620 --> 00:19:34.480
It's bad for your blood pressure.

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:37.150
Head Instructor Shian.

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:41.150
He said he was looking 
for the bathroom and got lost.

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:44.340
I could tell at a glance that 
he was one of the new kids.

00:19:44.340 --> 00:19:46.670
See? I brought him back.

00:19:46.670 --> 00:19:48.660
You damned newcomer!

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:49.940
Shut up.

00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:57.170
He was looking for the 
bathroom and got lost, you say?

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:58.840
Yeah.

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:01.420
You really think such indisputable trash

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:04.250
would actually have the courage to run away?

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:10.140
You know what happens 
to students who run away.

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:13.140
If you're covering for him, 
you'll be treated as complicit.

00:20:13.860 --> 00:20:16.180
<i>This is bad. It's all over!</i>

00:20:16.180 --> 00:20:19.290
<i>I've been so stupid. 
Why did I ever trust him?</i>

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:21.350
Listen to me, now.

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:25.070
The new blood here 
has become my dog.

00:20:30.920 --> 00:20:32.140
Fine.

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:35.250
Shin, you look after him.

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:39.080
Get him accustomed to the school's 
environment and rules quickly.

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:45.080
And let me offer 
you one word of warning.

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:46.550
There's a hard limit.

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:50.560
If you choose this trash, 
don't regret it later.

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:53.560
It's none of your business what I do.

00:20:55.050 --> 00:20:56.150
Let's go!

00:21:06.150 --> 00:21:08.740
<i>He talked his way past the instructors.</i>

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:11.900
<i>Incredible. He wasn't lying!</i>

00:21:12.260 --> 00:21:16.570
<i>Does that mean he wasn't lying 
about Shiori, either?</i>

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:26.420
Incredible. That bastard's 
gonna pay for this.

00:21:26.420 --> 00:21:28.920
He got off with just being 
chewed out by the head instructor?

00:21:28.920 --> 00:21:30.880
If he really had run away, 
we'd be in deep trouble.

00:21:30.880 --> 00:21:32.600
Huh? Where did the head instructor go?

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:36.260
To the headmistress's office. 
To make a report, I reckon.

00:21:42.290 --> 00:21:43.520
So, you're here.

00:21:44.330 --> 00:21:46.700
Forgive me. We had a bit of trouble.

00:21:48.380 --> 00:21:52.620
There's a student here who can give 
even you trouble, Head Instructor?

00:23:26.050 --> 00:23:39.850
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:26.340 --> 00:23:28.300
Yeah! I found it!

00:23:28.300 --> 00:23:30.990
Give back my phone!

00:23:29.910 --> 00:23:31.550
I know you've been hiding it.

00:23:31.550 --> 00:23:34.850
I can't survive without my phone!

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:34.760
Cell phones are forbidden on campus.

00:23:34.760 --> 00:23:37.350
You know what'll happen 
if they find you with this.

00:23:35.120 --> 00:23:39.850
Episode 2
"Between Cruelty and Kindness"

00:23:37.350 --> 00:23:38.200
Stop it.

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:39.810
You damned pig.
